\fBSUB_UID_MIN\fR=100000,
\fBSUB_UID_MAX\fR=200000,
\fBSUB_UID_COUNT\fR=65536, User A (UID 1000) gets range [100000, 165535] and User B (UID 1001) wraps and overlaps with User A\&. User B\*(Aqs container can now access files from User A\*(Aqs containers\&.
